Cell["\<\
We expect the moving quantum expectation value of position to trace an \
improved approximation to such a curve (with less rounded corners than were \
obtained previously) if we construct \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.428174658056073*^9, 3.428174815635707*^9}}],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{"Px", "[", 
  RowBox[{"x", ",", "t"}], "]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{"Py", "[", 
  RowBox[{"y", ",", "t"}], "]"}]}], "DisplayFormula",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.4281748260641003`*^9, 3.4281748535511627`*^9}}],

Cell["\<\
by launching wavepackets that are intially well localized, and keep t so \
short that the localization remains well-preserved. The computational burden \
of such an approach is, however, great, so I will not attempt to illustrate \
the remark by explicit example. In such \"hard\" situations the moving \
function P[x, y, t] would itself\[LongDash]not just the associated \
expectation values, and except for complications at the reflection points\
\[LongDash]trace (for a while) a recognizable approximation to a Lissajous \
figure. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.428174872875944*^9, 3.428174900093109*^9}, {
  3.428174941821776*^9, 3.428174970902869*^9}, {3.428175007790663*^9, 
  3.428175260499585*^9}}],

Cell[BoxData["\[IndentingNewLine]"], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.428175286546349*^9}]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
An alternative approach to the  quantum theory of Lissajous figures\
\>", "Subsubtitle",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.428176220804529*^9, 3.4281762477234497`*^9}}],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Recently, Y. F. Chen, K, F, Huang & Y. P. Lan were led (\"Localization of \
wave patterns on classical periodic orbits in a square billiard,\" Phys. Rev. \
E ",
 StyleBox["66",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ", 046215 (2002); \"Quantum manifestations of classical periodic orbits in a \
square billiard: Formation of vortex lattices,\"  Phys. Rev. E ",
 StyleBox["66",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ", 066210 (2002))\[LongDash]by appropriating the \"Schwinger representation \
of the SU(2) algebra,\" a train of thought which I will not attempt to \
reproduce\[LongDash]to write (in my notation)"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.428177419079582*^9, 3.428177635675181*^9}, {
  3.428177775966524*^9, 3.428177904127387*^9}}],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Clear", "[", "\[CapitalPsi]", "]"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.428177995632085*^9, 3.4281780244041243`*^9}, {
  3.428181949039814*^9, 3.428181957549941*^9}}],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"\[CapitalPsi]", "[", 
   RowBox[{"x_", ",", "y_", ",", "m_", ",", "n_"}], "]"}], ":=", 
  RowBox[{"2", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Sin", "[", 
    RowBox[{"m", " ", "\[Pi]", " ", "x"}], "]"}], 
   RowBox[{"Sin", "[", 
    RowBox[{"n", " ", "\[Pi]", " ", "y"}], "]"}]}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.427641354258855*^9, 3.427641421436613*^9}, {
  3.427641547855241*^9, 3.4276415520360947`*^9}, {3.4280784880663652`*^9, 
  3.428078546558466*^9}}],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"\[CapitalPsi]", "[", 
  RowBox[{"x", ",", "y", ",", 
   RowBox[{"k", "+", "1"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"n", "-", "k", "+", "1"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.4281779092593927`*^9, 3.4281779219391613`*^9}, {
  3.428177982430242*^9, 3.428177984400152*^9}, {3.428178036750904*^9, 
  3.428178053740436*^9}}],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"2", " ", 
  RowBox[{"Sin", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"1", "+", "k"}], ")"}], " ", "\[Pi]", " ", "x"}], "]"}], " ", 
  RowBox[{"Sin", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"1", "-", "k", "+", "n"}], ")"}], " ", "\[Pi]", " ", "y"}], 
   "]"}]}]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.428178057148266*^9, 3.428180012102274*^9, 
  3.428180067851266*^9, 3.4281818588178253`*^9, 3.428181926818356*^9, 
  3.428181979291135*^9}]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["and from those functions to construct", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.428178091501243*^9, 3.4281780964338017`*^9}}],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Chen", "[", 
   RowBox[{
   "x_", ",", "y_", ",", "n_", ",", " ", "p_", ",", " ", "q_", ",", 
    "\[Phi]_"}], "]"}], ":=", 
  RowBox[{
   FractionBox["1", 
    SuperscriptBox["2", 
     RowBox[{"n", "/", "2"}]]], 
   RowBox[{
    UnderoverscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
     RowBox[{"k", "=", "0"}], "n"], 
    RowBox[{
     SqrtBox[
      RowBox[{"Binomial", "[", 
       RowBox[{"n", ",", "k"}], "]"}]], 
     SuperscriptBox["\[ExponentialE]", 
      RowBox[{"\[ImaginaryI]", " ", "k", " ", "\[Phi]"}]], 
     RowBox[{"\[CapitalPsi]", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"p", " ", "x"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"q", " ", "y"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"k", "+", "1"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"n", "-", "k", "+", "1"}]}], "]"}]}]}]}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.428178110952714*^9, 3.428178232602951*^9}, {
   3.428178296656673*^9, 3.4281783686150293`*^9}, 3.428178493192604*^9, {
   3.428181997895899*^9, 3.428181999547515*^9}}],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

